sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant Script as scripts/dev/start.sh
    participant Platform as infra/local Compose
    participant Edge as edge MCP Compose
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant API as sre-agent-api
    participant UI as Next.js console

    Operator->>Script: Start local stacks
    Script->>Script: Create env files and internal secrets
    Script->>Platform: Build and start control plane
    Platform->>DB: Start and wait for health
    Platform->>API: Start runtime
    API->>DB: Apply migrations
    Platform->>UI: Start console
    Script->>Edge: Build and start authenticated MCP servers
    UI-->>Operator: Ready on localhost:3002
